WEBVTT

NOTE
End of Disc 1 cliffhanger — Edea conjures an ice shard and impales Squall.
Duration: approximately 50 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Blue magical energy gathers around Edea before the golden web.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.400
She raises her hand and conjures an enormous shard of jagged ice.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.170
She hurls the shard forward.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.780
The glowing teal ice spike pierces toward Squall in profile.
